{"title": "An AVL rotation", "view": "tree", "steps": [{"nodes": [{"id": "v30", "label": "30", "parent": null}, {"id": "v20", "label": "20", "parent": "v30"}, {"id": "v10", "label": "10", "parent": "v20"}, {"id": "v20-right", "label": "", "parent": "v20", "hidden": true}, {"id": "v30-right", "label": "", "parent": "v30", "hidden": true}], "active": "v30", "vars": {"balance(30)": "left 2, right 0"}, "caption": "AVL rule: at every node, the heights of the two subtrees differ by at most 1. Node 30 is off by 2 (left-left case)."}, {"nodes": [{"id": "v30", "label": "30", "parent": null}, {"id": "v20", "label": "20", "parent": "v30"}, {"id": "v10", "label": "10", "parent": "v20"}, {"id": "v20-right", "label": "", "parent": "v20", "hidden": true}, {"id": "v30-right", "label": "", "parent": "v30", "hidden": true}], "highlight": ["v20"], "vars": {"fix": "right rotation at 30"}, "caption": "Right rotation: 20 moves up to take 30's place, 30 becomes 20's right child. (20's old right subtree, if any, becomes 30's left.)"}, {"nodes": [{"id": "v20", "label": "20", "parent": null}, {"id": "v10", "label": "10", "parent": "v20"}, {"id": "v30", "label": "30", "parent": "v20"}], "highlight": ["v20"], "vars": {"height": "3 \u2192 2"}, "caption": "Balanced again, and it's still a valid BST: 10 < 20 < 30. A rotation is O(1): only three pointers change."}]}
